title: v6.3.1 — University bug fix pass (crash on load, PLSAT dead, 5 broken quizzes)
summary: Full university triage before video launch week. Team audit (architect + Nora + Scholar + reviewer) surfaced 10 bugs across the UI, server, and content files. CourseView crashed on every lesson load due to unguarded .keyConcepts/.quiz access; PLSAT was completely inaccessible due to a hardcoded /api/plsat/3.0 fetch against a broken v3 YAML; five quiz files had either YAML parse errors (unquoted colon-space in scalars) or wrong schema (options/integer instead of choices/letter). All 10 fixed, verified, rebuilt, and published as v6.3.1.
