decisions:
  - id: university-null-guard
    decision: Guard both keyConcepts and quiz with optional chaining in CourseView; normalize server to always return [] for both fields
    rationale: Type says required arrays but server omits them when absent — dual fix prevents future drift
  - id: plsat-dynamic-version
    decision: Fetch /api/plsat to get available versions rather than hardcoding 3.0
    rationale: Hardcoded version breaks silently when that version has a parse error; dynamic fetch auto-recovers
errors_encountered:
  - description: CourseView.tsx:114 crash — activeLesson.keyConcepts undefined on any lesson without quiz data
    resolution: 'Optional chaining: keyConcepts?.length ?? 0'
  - description: PLSATView hardcoded /api/plsat/3.0 — v3 YAML broken, server 500, silent dead-end UI
    resolution: Dynamic version fetch via /api/plsat, load highest available
  - description: Q-plsat-v3.yaml two YAML parse errors — unquoted colon-space in choice C and variant scenario
    resolution: Single-quoted choice C; double-quoted scenario field
  - description: Q-para-701-arch-mcp-tools.yaml three YAML parse errors across explanation/question/choice fields
    resolution: Double-quoted all three affected strings
  - description: Q-para-401 and Q-para-501 wrong schema — options/integer instead of choices/letter
    resolution: Full rewrite of both quiz files to correct schema
